<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="64" height="64">
  <!-- Tray icon: a simple upright ghost, sized and weighted like other panel
       icons. @COLOR@ is replaced per state by make icons; the eyes are cut out
       so the panel shows through. -->
